# Local ScreenScraper development credentials.
#
# Copy to `.env` (which is git-ignored) and fill in the values issued to RetroFrontier by
# ScreenScraper. Never commit real values, and never paste someone else's application credential.
#
# Release builds do not read this file: they receive the same variables through protected
# build-time injection. A distributed desktop binary makes an application credential recoverable,
# so this is an application identity, not a confidentiality boundary.
RETROFRONTIER_SCREENSCRAPER_DEV_ID=
RETROFRONTIER_SCREENSCRAPER_DEV_PASSWORD=
